{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Pyromancer Aspect of Time chains up to 3 additional casts (#13732)",
  "contract": [
    "Aspect of Time 504750 (Draconic level-20 passive, ProcChance 33, EffectBasePoints[0] 44 + DieSides 1 = 45%)",
    "reads: Damage dealt by Echo of Nozdormu and Flames of Neltharion now has a 33% chance to cast an additional",
    "time for 45% of the damage dealt. Damage dealt in this way can trigger this effect up to 3 additional times.",
    "Aspect's Blessing 802168 guarantees the initial Aspect of Time trigger. Helper 503864 has Speed 35.0 in",
    "Spell.dbc, so Spell::AddUnitTarget always delays its hit by at least 142 ms (min 5 yd / 35 yd/s). Previously",
    "AscensionPyromancer::Aspect looped synchronously reading State(player).aspectDamage right after Copy(), which",
    "was always 0 until 503864 landed asynchronously, breaking the loop after 1 hit. Chaining from 503864's",
    "OnSpellHitResult with per-Spell remaining depth 3->2->1->0 delivers up to 4 total 503864 hits summing to",
    "0.45 + 0.45^2 + 0.45^3 + 0.45^4 (~0.7846) of Echo of Nozdormu damage. A -100% SPELLMOD_CHANCE_OF_SUCCESS",
    "mutant on 504750 proves Aspect's Blessing triggers only 1 hit (~0.45) when chain procs fail; a +300% mutant",
    "(33% * 4 = 100% clamped) proves both Aspect's Blessing and plain Echo of Nozdormu chain to exactly 4 hits and",
    "stop at the 3-additional-trigger cap. Level-80 Pyromancer with active Echo of Nozdormu Rank 10 (567590),",
    "spell penetration aura 823764, and spell_hit_rating 10000."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
